# Deny everything, then name what the build needs. The Dockerfile copies only
# these paths anyway; this makes the guarantee structural, so no .env, no
# credential, and no local artifact is ever inside the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!config.toml
!app
app/**/__pycache__
# The operator commands run from this image as Cloud Run jobs, so the schema
# and the approved policy set travel with it. Neither runtime reads them.
!migrations
!policies
